fix(floats_round): emulate directed rounding when the FPU cannot

WebAssembly only rounds to nearest. floats_round.c emulates the other
directions in software (SOFT_ROUNDING) when compiled to wasm or when
the C library lacks them, and float.ml converts Z.t to floats with
these roundings instead of the global mode. On i386 floats_round.c is
compiled with SSE2 arithmetic, as it needs FLT_EVAL_METHOD == 0.

